<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian three-month T-bills yields creep up.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian three-month T-bills yields creep up.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on three-month Lithuanian Treasury bills edged up at Monday's auction even though the issue was oversubscribed, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD  (LAST TIME)   MIN/MAX    ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 91-days     14.58	13.67	12.50/15.46  50    63    50</p>
<p>The settlement date is November 7 and the issue matures on February 6.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
